    "amount": "$3,000",
    "amountNumeric": 3000,
    "description": "Because I am from the area, I have many connections here in MN. I used my relationships with people, place, land, and water to guide me. I added names of reputable, grassroots non-profits in the area. Then I sent an email to certain groups I felt were in need of support. Each entity, if they wanted to be a recipient, sent an email detailing what they planned to do with the funds or we had a phone call to talk through those details (in some cases both emails and phone calls were employed). From those conversations, I could make a more intuitive decision around who would be recipients of the funds.",
